        <mxCell id="S7JAt9fSs67FxyDCQKuD-6" value="&lt;span data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: color(srgb 0.164706 0.164706 0.164706 / 0.296471); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Goal&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: Goal: Evaluate how an MCP-like SSE server’s resource usage and latency scales with concurrent streams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: color(srgb 0.164706 0.164706 0.164706 / 0.296471); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-lexical-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: color(srgb 0.164706 0.164706 0.164706 / 0.296471); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Experiment flow:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Start the local server with lightweight per-stream state and heartbeats; for each N in a sweep, create N streams via JSON-RPC, attach N SSE clients for a fixed duration, and poll the server’s /metrics; aggregate per-connection results and server time series, then plot and summarize.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;text-align: start; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: color(srgb 0.164706 0.164706 0.164706 / 0.296471); text-decoration-thickness: 